      "side": 1,
      "message": "Performance: Iterating over all configs for every source file can be slow for large targets. Consider collecting all unique `additional_outputs` patterns from the target and its configs into a temporary vector once before starting the `for (const auto\u0026 source : target_-\u003esources())` loop.",
