      "writtenOn": "2026-04-21T10:17:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Check for duplicates: If multiple configs define the same pattern, `tool_outputs` will contain duplicate entries. Ninja may complain or behave unexpectedly if the same file is listed as an output multiple times on the same build line. Consider checking if the output is already present in `tool_outputs` before pushing.",
